  "description": "ZIXJAV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H92 Dy6 N14 O28. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.694-3.854 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.11-109.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L1)2(μ3-O)4(OAc)6(H2O)4]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
